# wasm-pack build output — a generated artifact (CI regenerates + attaches it to
# the GH release). wasm-pack also writes a pkg/.gitignore of `*`, but ignore it at
# the repo root too so no variant (bundler / nodejs / web out-dir) is ever staged.
crates/argus-redact-wasm/pkg/
crates/argus-redact-wasm/pkg-*/

# member-level lock files would shadow the workspace-root lock
crates/*/Cargo.lock

# Workspace-only design / planning artifacts (per convention — not committed)
docs/design-pseudonym-llm.md
docs/roadmap-v0.5.x.md
docs/superpowers/

# mutmut workspace (regenerated on every `mutmut run`)
mutants/
mutmut-stats.json

# cargo-mutants scratch output (regenerated on every `make mutants-core`)
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
mutants.out*/
